<title>USA: Escalade sees share buyback at $8.875/shr.</title>
<headline>Escalade sees share buyback at $8.875/shr.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Escalade Inc said it expects to repurchase about one million shares of its common stock for stockholders for $8.875 per share, based on a preliminary count by the depositary for its dutch auction tender offer.</p>
<p>The sporting goods and graphic arts products maker said it expects to buy back 24.7 percent of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
